    ],
    "en": [
      "Milan Cortina 2026 Winter Olympics from February 6 to 22. Events broadcast: Biathlon, alpine skiing, freestyle skiing, snowbording, ski mountaineering. Snack bar, bar, restaurant on site\r\n(Evening restaurant only, booking required by 2pm on the day)"
    ],
    "it": [
